The Policy Analyzer reviews the firewall rule set without changing it:
shadowed, redundant, duplicate and unused rules, overly permissive and
WAN exposed rules, rules that never match or are inactive, disabled
rules, missing descriptions and empty or unused aliases.  Every finding
links to the rule in Firewall: Rules, where the administrator decides
what to change.

Optionally, an AI provider (Ollama on this firewall or in the network,
or the Anthropic Claude API) explains findings in plain language.  This
is opt-in, data is anonymized before it is sent by default, every request
is audited and the AI never applies changes.

